<https://w3id.org/eudpp/battery-statuses> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Ontology> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/battery-statuses> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionIRI> <https://w3id.org/eudpp/battery-statuses/0.1.1> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/battery-statuses> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/bibliographicCitation> "EU DPP Battery Statuses Vocabulary. Draft version 0.1.1."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/battery-statuses> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Arnab Sinha"@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/battery-statuses> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/created> "2026-08-19"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/battery-statuses> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/creator> "Marc-Andree Wolf"@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/battery-statuses> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/creator> "Nader Jelassi"@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/battery-statuses> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "The five lifecycle statuses of a battery required by Regulation (EU) 2023/1542, Annex XIII 4(c): original, repurposed, re-used, remanufactured and waste. Value set of bat:hasBatteryStatus. Distinct from the status of the digital passport, which is carried by the cross-sectoral dpp:dppStatus."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/battery-statuses> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/issued> "2026-08-19"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/battery-statuses> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/license> <https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/battery-statuses> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/license> "This ontology is licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0. In case of dispute over Apache 2.0 applicability, or in case considering the ontology as a document, this ontology document is to be considered licensed under the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC BY 4.0)."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/battery-statuses> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/modified> "2026-09-01"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/battery-statuses> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/references> "Regulation (EU) 2023/1542, Annex XIII 4(c); BatteryPass-Ready Data Attribute Long List v1.3, attribute 20"@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/battery-statuses> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> <https://eur-lex.europa.eu/eli/reg/2023/1542/oj> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/battery-statuses> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/title> "EU DPP Battery Statuses Vocabulary"@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/battery-statuses> <http://purl.org/vocab/vann/preferredNamespacePrefix> "batstat" .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/battery-statuses> <http://purl.org/vocab/vann/preferredNamespaceUri> "https://w3id.org/eudpp/battery-statuses#" .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/battery-statuses> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Developed against the CIRPASS-2 CORE ontology v2.0.5 (refresh of 25 August 2026; P_DPP v2.0.6 of 27 August 2026, MAT v1.0.2). External references are pinned to these versions."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/battery-statuses> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "EU DPP Battery Statuses Vocabulary"@en .
