# https://w3id.org/eudpp/battery-statuses#BatteryStatusScheme
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/battery-statuses#BatteryStatusScheme> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/battery-statuses#BatteryStatusScheme> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#ConceptScheme> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/battery-statuses#BatteryStatusScheme> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/references> "Regulation (EU) 2023/1542, Annex XIII 4(c); BatteryPass-Ready Data Attribute Long List v1.3, attribute 20"@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/battery-statuses#BatteryStatusScheme> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://w3id.org/eudpp/battery-statuses> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/battery-statuses#BatteryStatusScheme> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Battery lifecycle statuses per Annex XIII 4(c)"@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/battery-statuses#BatteryStatusScheme> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#hasTopConcept> <https://w3id.org/eudpp/battery-statuses#Original> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/battery-statuses#BatteryStatusScheme> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#hasTopConcept> <https://w3id.org/eudpp/battery-statuses#ReUsed> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/battery-statuses#BatteryStatusScheme> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#hasTopConcept> <https://w3id.org/eudpp/battery-statuses#Remanufactured> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/battery-statuses#BatteryStatusScheme> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#hasTopConcept> <https://w3id.org/eudpp/battery-statuses#Repurposed> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/battery-statuses#BatteryStatusScheme> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#hasTopConcept> <https://w3id.org/eudpp/battery-statuses#Waste> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/battery-statuses#BatteryStatusScheme> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Battery lifecycle statuses per Annex XIII 4(c)"@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/battery-statuses#BatteryStatusScheme> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "Closed list of five terms. The status is dynamic at individual-battery granularity: it is updated on placing on the market and on every status change. A new battery passport is issued when the battery has been remanufactured, repurposed or subjected to a treatment operation preparing for re-use or repurposing and is placed on the market again; the link back to the previous passport is carried by the CORE property dpp:linkToPreviousDPP, not by this vocabulary. Access to the battery status is restricted to persons with a legitimate interest — a conformance rule expressed in the SHACL shapes, not in this ontology."@en .
# 
# https://w3id.org/eudpp/battery-statuses#Original
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/battery-statuses#Original> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/battery-statuses#Original> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/battery-statuses#Original> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/references> "Regulation (EU) 2023/1542, Annex XIII 4(c)"@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/battery-statuses#Original> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://w3id.org/eudpp/battery-statuses> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/battery-statuses#Original> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Original"@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/battery-statuses#Original> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The battery is in its first life, as placed on the market by the manufacturer, and has not been subjected to re-use, repurposing or remanufacturing."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/battery-statuses#Original> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://w3id.org/eudpp/battery-statuses#BatteryStatusScheme> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/battery-statuses#Original> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "original" .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/battery-statuses#Original> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Original"@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/battery-statuses#Original> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#topConceptOf> <https://w3id.org/eudpp/battery-statuses#BatteryStatusScheme> .
# 
# https://w3id.org/eudpp/battery-statuses#ReUsed
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/battery-statuses#ReUsed> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/battery-statuses#ReUsed> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/battery-statuses#ReUsed> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/references> "Regulation (EU) 2023/1542, Annex XIII 4(c)"@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/battery-statuses#ReUsed> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://w3id.org/eudpp/battery-statuses> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/battery-statuses#ReUsed> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Re-used"@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/battery-statuses#ReUsed> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "reused"@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/battery-statuses#ReUsed> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The battery has been subjected to a treatment operation preparing it for re-use and placed on the market again for the purpose it was originally designed for."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/battery-statuses#ReUsed> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://w3id.org/eudpp/battery-statuses#BatteryStatusScheme> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/battery-statuses#ReUsed> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "re-used" .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/battery-statuses#ReUsed> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Re-used"@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/battery-statuses#ReUsed> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "A repaired battery is recorded under this status, with the repair itself made transparent through the repair history. The history belongs to the CORE event module (dpp:RepairEvent); no 'repaired' status is declared here."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/battery-statuses#ReUsed> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#topConceptOf> <https://w3id.org/eudpp/battery-statuses#BatteryStatusScheme> .
# 
# https://w3id.org/eudpp/battery-statuses#Remanufactured
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/battery-statuses#Remanufactured> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/battery-statuses#Remanufactured> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/battery-statuses#Remanufactured> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/references> "Regulation (EU) 2023/1542, Annex XIII 4(c)"@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/battery-statuses#Remanufactured> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://w3id.org/eudpp/battery-statuses> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/battery-statuses#Remanufactured> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Remanufactured"@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/battery-statuses#Remanufactured> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The battery has been subjected to remanufacturing and placed on the market again."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/battery-statuses#Remanufactured> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#editorialNote> "Remanufacturing is an ESPR-wide notion, not a battery-specific one. This is the concept most likely to move to the CORE if a generic product status is introduced."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/battery-statuses#Remanufactured> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://w3id.org/eudpp/battery-statuses#BatteryStatusScheme> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/battery-statuses#Remanufactured> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "remanufactured" .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/battery-statuses#Remanufactured> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Remanufactured"@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/battery-statuses#Remanufactured> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#topConceptOf> <https://w3id.org/eudpp/battery-statuses#BatteryStatusScheme> .
# 
# https://w3id.org/eudpp/battery-statuses#Repurposed
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/battery-statuses#Repurposed> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/battery-statuses#Repurposed> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/battery-statuses#Repurposed> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/references> "Regulation (EU) 2023/1542, Annex XIII 4(c)"@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/battery-statuses#Repurposed> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://w3id.org/eudpp/battery-statuses> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/battery-statuses#Repurposed> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Repurposed"@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/battery-statuses#Repurposed> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The battery has been subjected to repurposing and placed on the market again for a purpose or application other than the one it was originally designed for."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/battery-statuses#Repurposed> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#editorialNote> "The definition of 'repurposing' is in Art. 3(1) of Regulation (EU) 2023/1542; the point number is to be confirmed against the consolidated text."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/battery-statuses#Repurposed> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://w3id.org/eudpp/battery-statuses#BatteryStatusScheme> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/battery-statuses#Repurposed> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "repurposed" .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/battery-statuses#Repurposed> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Repurposed"@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/battery-statuses#Repurposed> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#topConceptOf> <https://w3id.org/eudpp/battery-statuses#BatteryStatusScheme> .
# 
# https://w3id.org/eudpp/battery-statuses#Waste
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/battery-statuses#Waste> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/battery-statuses#Waste> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/battery-statuses#Waste> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/references> "Regulation (EU) 2023/1542, Annex XIII 4(c)"@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/battery-statuses#Waste> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://w3id.org/eudpp/battery-statuses> .
